-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",148,{
[4705]="70051602\n1\tMinas Agar stands on the western side of Barad Gúlaran, south of Gath Forthnír. You must travel to Barad Gúlaran and defeat Karstíona, the emissary of the Trév Duvárdain, inside Minas Agar.\t\n2\tTalk to Brúnfair\tBrúnfair is in Gath Forthnír, north of Barad Gúlaran. Having defeated Karstíona, you should return to Brúnfair and tell him of your success.\n",
[4706]="70051609\n1\tMinas Caul is one of the large towers of Barad Gúlaran, south of Gath Forthnír. You must travel to Barad Gúlaran and issue a challenge to Bâlak, the emissary of the White-hand, inside Minas Caul.\t\n2\tTalk to Brúnfair\tBrúnfair is at Gath Forthnír, north of Barad Gúlaran. Having defeated Bâlak, you should return to Gath Forthnír and tell Brúnfair that you have accomplished the deed.\n",
[4707]="70034557\n1\tExplore Dunfast\tThe village of Dunfast is in the centre of the Whitshaws. You should examine Dunfast for clues as to why it is empty.\n2\tThe village of Dunfast is in the centre of the Whitshaws. You should examine Dunfast for clues as to why it is empty.\t\n3\tReturn to Cyneberg\tCyneberg is at Dunfast. You should tell Cyneberg what you found.\n",
[4708]="700396C4\n1\tThane Mágla's home can be found directly to the south-east of the Mead Hall in Middlemead. Thane Mágla has asked that you gather keepsakes from his bedside and return them to him, so his council might gather once last time.\t\n2\tPlace the horseshoe at Mágla's side\tEmpty chairs can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Middlemead. You have gathered the keepsakes of Thane Mágla's councilmen. You should now return them to Mágla's side.\n3\tPlace the shield at Mágla's side\tEmpty chairs can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Middlemead. You have gathered the keepsakes of Thane Mágla's councilmen. You should continue to place them at Mágla's side.\n4\tPlace the sword at Mágla's side\tEmpty chairs can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Middlemead. You have gathered the keepsakes of Thane Mágla's councilmen. You should continue to place them at Mágla's side.\n5\tPlace the horn at Mágla's side\tEmpty chairs can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Middlemead. You have gathered the keepsakes of Thane Mágla's councilmen. You should continue to place them at Mágla's side.\n6\tTalk to Thane Mágla\tThane Mágla can be found in the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\n",
[4709]="70024BD3\n1\tPick up one of the kegs at the servants' area\tFresh kegs can be picked up near the servants' oven in Winter-home. You should deliver the keg to the festival square, but mind that nobody important catches you!\n2\tDeliver the replacement keg to the festival square\tFresh kegs can be picked up near the servants' oven in Winter-home and should be brought to the edge of the festival square, where patrons must surely be getting thirsty. You should deliver the keg to the festival square, but mind that nobody important catches you! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Basil Wyndham\tBasil Wyndham is in Winter-home, sitting and enjoying the merriment in the festival square. You should speak with the servant Basil Wyndham.\n",
[4710]="7000EAA7\n1\tTalk to Olavi\tYou will find Olavi east and slightly south of Sûri-kylä at his fishing camp along the road to Itä-mâ. Nôra has asked you to tell Olavi to bring him as many buckets of dried fish as he is able.\n2\tCatch oily fish (total: 10)\tThe fish Nôra requires can be found along the ice bay west of Olavi's camp. Olavi has asked you to take a fishing-pole and collect the fish Nôra requires.\n3\tTalk to Nôra\030Collect Oily Fish (total: 10)\tNôra is at Sûri-kylä. You caught the fish where Olavi said you would. You should now bring the fish to Nôra in Sûri-kylä.\n",
[4711]="7004089E\n1\tDefeat Corsair foremen (total: 3)\tThe Corsair foremen are patrolling the large cave beneath Emyn Ernil. Lhossil asked you to defeat the Corsair foremen directing the miners beneath Emyn Ernil.\n2\tSpeak to Lhossil\tLhossil can be found in Dol Amroth. Lhossil will be very pleased to hear the Corsair foremen have been eliminated.\n",
[4712]="7004089F\n1\tDefeat Corsair miners (total: 3)\tCorsair miners are digging in the large cave beneath Emyn Ernil. Lhossil asked you to defeat the Corsair miners digging beneath Emyn Ernil.\n2\tSpeak to Lhossil\tLhossil can be found in Dol Amroth. Lhossil will be very pleased to hear the Corsair miners have been defeated.\n",
[4713]="7004089D\n1\tRepair rotting scaffold (total: 5)\tRotting scaffolding may be found in the large cave beneath Emyn Ernil. Lhossil asked you to venture beneath Emyn Ernil and repair some of the scaffold within that is rotting away.\n2\tSpeak to Lhossil\tLhossil can be found in Dol Amroth. Lhossil will be pleased to hear the scaffold has been shored up.\n",
[4714]="7004089C\n1\tAcquire crystal shards (total: 8)\tCrystal shards may be found in the large cave beneath Emyn Ernil. Lhossil asked you to venture beneath Emyn Ernil and recover some crystal shards from the large cave.\n2\tSpeak to Lhossil\tLhossil can be found in Dol Amroth. Lhossil will be pleased to begin examining the crystal shards you found.\n",
[4715]="70040896\n1\tDefeat deep-claw diggers (total: 6)\tDeep-claws are digging in the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil. Gelloth asked you to defeat the deep-claws that are threatening to collapse the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil.\n2\tSpeak to Gelloth\tGelloth can be found in Dol Amroth. Gelloth will be very pleased to hear the tunnels are safe from collapse.\n",
[4716]="70040894\n1\tDefeat Corsair surveyors (total: 6)\tThe Corsair surveyors are exploring the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil. Gelloth asked you to prevent the Corsair surveyors from exploring and mapping the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil.\n2\tSpeak to Gelloth\tGelloth can be found in Dol Amroth. Gelloth will be very pleased to hear the surveyors have been eliminated.\n",
[4717]="7004088E\n1\tAcquire ore (total: 10)\tOre may be found in the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil. Gelloth asked you to venture beneath Emyn Ernil and try to find ore within the tunnels.\n2\tSpeak to Gelloth\tGelloth can be found in Dol Amroth. Gelloth will be pleased to process the ore you found beneath Emyn Ernil.\n",
[4718]="70040897\n1\tMark posts (total: 4)\tPosts can be found in the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil. Gelloth asked you to venture beneath Emyn Ernil and mark the posts throughout the tunnels to aid in navigation.\n2\tSpeak to Gelloth\tGelloth can be found in Dol Amroth. Gelloth will be pleased to hear the posts have been marked.\n",
[4719]="70015E45\n1\tDefeat crawlers (total: 12)\tCrawlers can be found at Emyn Naer, south-west of Echad Dúnann. Tinúriel has asked that you slay the corrupt crawlers of Emyn Naer.\n2\tTalk to Tinúriel at Echad Dúnann\tTinúriel is in Echad Dúnann, north-east of Emyn Naer. You should return at once to Tinúriel and inform her of your success.\n",
[4720]="7004799E\n1\tDefeat Mordor bruisers (total: 12)\tMordor bruisers can be found within Skoironk. You should defeat Mordor bruisers.\n2\tReturn to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\n",
[4721]="7003FE7E\n1\tDefeat avanc near Gladion's farm (0/8)\tAvanc can be found west of Gladion's farm in northern Lamedon. You should defeat the encroaching avanc near Gladion's homestead.\n2\tDefeat avanc near Gladion's farm (total: 8)\tAvanc can be found west of Gladion's farm in northern Lamedon, in the town of Dínadab. You should defeat the encroaching avanc near Gladion's homestead.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many avanc near Gladion's farm.\n",
[4722]="70035597\n1\tDefeat Snowy Grims\tSnowy Grims, surely springing up due to the nearness of Núrzum, can be found throughout the High Knolls. You should defeat Snowy Grims.\n2\tDefeat Snowy Grims (total: 8)\tSnowy Grims, surely springing up due to the nearness of Núrzum, can be found throughout the High Knolls. You should defeat Snowy Grims.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have driven back a number of the snowy grims that have appeared in the High Knolls.\n",
[4723]="7000EF7B\n1\tDefeat kalpa-kita in Itä-mâ (total: 18)\tKalpa-kita can be found throughout the tundra of Itä-mâ. Âtos has asked you to help purge Itä-mâ of the kalpa-kita scourge.\n2\tTalk to Âtos\tÂtos is at Pynti-leiri. Now that you have defeated many kalpa-kita, you should return to Âtos.\n",
[4724]="70043DF4\n1\tDefeat Spiders (total: 12)\tSpiders can be found on the Western side of Osgiliath. You should defeat the encroaching Spiders.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Spiders in Western Osgiliath.\n",
[4725]="7004CE2E\n1\tTravel to Esgaroth-of-old\tEsgaroth-of-old can be found east of Loeglond, on the Long Lake. You should travel to Esgaroth-of-old.\n2\tTalk to Mervárth\tMervárth is standing guard outside Esgaroth-of-old. You should talk to Mervárth.\n",
[4726]="70041861\n1\tDefeat Corsair scouts near Malbarth (total: 4)\tCorsair scouts can be found on the outskirts of Malbarth in north-western Lebennin. Melawen has asked you to search for and defeat any Corsair scouts encroaching on Malbarth.\n2\tTalk to Melawen\tMelawen can be found in Malbarth in north-western Lebennin. You have defeated many Corsair scouts and should now return to Melawen.\n",
[4727]="7000A8F7\n1\tDefeat Dolvaethor\030Restore Valandil's remains to peace\tDolvaethor is inside Haudh Valandil on the island upon which stands Ost Elendil, beyond the bridge of Ariant, in Annúminas. Glangilith has asked you to defeat Dolvaethor and put an end to whatever evil he plans for Haudh Valandil.\n",
[4728]="70040FD5\n1\tAid the dying Elf\tThe dying Elf can be found in southern Edhellond, hiding amongst bushes. You have come across a dying Elf and should now aid him in realizing his dying wish.\n2\tTalk to the dying Elf\tThe dying Elf can be found at the top of a tower in Edhellond. You have successfully escorted the dying Elf to the top of the tower overlooking the Bay of Belfalas. You should speak to him.\n",
[4729]="7000885B\n1\tDefeat Wintersebb Drakeling (total: 5)\030Defeat Wintersebb Drake (total: 4)\tWintersebb-drakes can be found north in the area of Arador's End. Lieutenant Swithulf directed you to make your way north with others in search of a way to destroy the Wintersebb-drakes.\n2\tReturn to Lieutenant Swithulf at the Grimwood Lumber Camp\tLieutenant Swithulf awaits your return at the Grimwood Lumber-yard. Climbing high into the foothills of the Mountains of Angmar in Arador's end, you faced down many foes from the Wintersebb-brood and emerged to collect your reward.\n",
[4730]="700001AA\n1\tEscort Dírdrë to safety\tÉa is at Tármunn Súrsa, near Carn Dûm. Dírdrë has asked your aid returning to her mother, Éa.\n2\tTalk to Éa\tÉa is at Tármunn Súrsa, near Carn Dûm. You returned Dírdrë to the Hillmen. You should speak with Éa, her mother, at once.\n",
[4731]="700001A6\n1\tDefeat Lagmâs\tThe leader of the Orc-army makes his home deep within Urugarth, west of Gath Forthnír. Donaith told you of a mighty Uruk-general that must be defeated.\n2\tTalk to Donaith\tDonaith is at Gath Forthnír, east of Urugarth. You should return to Gath Forthnír and tell Donaith the good news of your victory.\n",
[4732]="7000807F\n1\tDefeat Gajarpan\tGajarpan can be found far north of the treasure hunters' camp. Erl Fisher has asked you to slay Gajarpan, the oldest and most fearsome of worms. NOTE: Small fellowship recommended.\n2\tReturn to Erl Fisher\tErl Fisher is at the treasure hunters' camp in the ruins of Fornost City. You should speak with Erl Fisher.\n",
[4733]="70027104\n1\tTalk to Blaire when you are ready to leave for Lhan Colvarn\tBlaire is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn. Blaire has asked you to accompany him to Lhan Colvarn for a night raid.\n2\tTalk to Blaire at the Boar-clan encampment\tBlaire is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn. You should talk to Blaire now that you have ended the Abomination threat.\n",
[4734]="70053F20\n1\tGather salves (total: 4)\tSalves can be found in Díngarth. You should gather salves for wounded soldiers.\n2\tWounded soldiers can be found in Díngarth. You should tend to the wounded soldiers.\t\n3\tTalk to Círdan\tCírdan can be found in Díngarth. You should talk to Círdan.\n",
[4735]="70027229\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Grey Company.\n",
[4736]="7002722A\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Friend of the Grey Company.\n",
})
